      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pathologies such as autism or deficit psychosis present an \"absence of language\". This makes it difficult for distress to be spotted. Any pain, either physical or psychological, is manifested through the body. The nursingteam is a major resource especially when it is supported by reflection and specific nursing tools."},
